    <p>Paste your <strong>robots.txt</strong> and this <strong>free LLM SEO checker</strong> shows exactly which AI crawlers — ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, Apple Intelligence — can actually read your site. No signup, nothing leaves your browser.</p>
  </div>
